msgctxt "3764"
msgid ""
"Oh, here's somethin' ya might like to know. This hostess\r\n"
"thing? It's just a little part-time gig. Believe it or not,\r\n"
"I work in an office during the day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3776"
msgid "I see. So this is your way of making a quick buck, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3788"
msgid "Pretty much."
msgstr "Più o meno."

msgctxt "3800"
msgid "Only downside is, I can't drink⑬not even a sip!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3812"
msgid "Alcohol gives me these huuuuge migraines..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3824"
msgid "Go figure. I never exactly pegged you for a drinker."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3836"
msgid ""
"Well good, 'cause I ain't one by a longshot. And the manager\r\n"
"here nearly blows a fuse 'cause I don't drink with customers..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3848"
msgid "Heh. I'll bet he does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3860"
msgid "Let me ask ya, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3872"
msgid "Is it bad that I don't drink on the job? Give me your honest opinion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3884"
msgid "I'm surprised you can get away with not drinking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3896"
msgid "Ain't that the truth! Hehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3908"
msgid "Guess I have it pretty easy here, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3920"
msgid "Heh. Maybe so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3932"
msgid ""
"Don't go trying to convince me, either! I ain't drinkin' a drop, even if ya "
"got down on your hands n' knees and begged!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3944"
msgid ""
"But don't you worry! I make up for my alcohol abstinence with my charmin' "
"good looks, great sense of humor, and lovable personality! Don't ya think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3956"
msgid "Heh, I suppose so."
msgstr "Eh, immagino di sì."

msgctxt "3968"
msgid "Can you really not drink at all?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3980"
msgid "That's what I said."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3992"
msgid "Even putting my lips to the glass gets my temples poundin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4004"
msgid "Ouch. Better stay away from it, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4016"
msgid ""
"Yep. Then there's the fact that my face gets all red when I'm drunk, which I"
" don't like. And if that ain't enough, I've never drunk a drink I liked to "
"begin with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4028"
msgid ""
"They say you lose out on half of life's pleasures when ya\r\n"
"can't drink... Or somethin' to that effect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4040"
msgid ""
"Though I will admit there's a part of me that gets a little jealous seeing "
"folks cut loose and party it up with their booze... Not really sure why."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4052"
msgid "Maybe you'll find out someday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4064"
msgid ""
"Hey, as long as I can still enjoy my drinks, then I don't see it as a "
"problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4076"
msgid "Well that's a mature way of lookin' at it. Thank goodness. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4088"
msgid ""
"See, the worst thing for me is being around stuffy old middle management "
"types who keep pesterin' me to drink... It's like, shut up, ya dirty old "
"men!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4100"
msgid "Ahahaha... ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4112"
msgid ""
"But don't you worry! I make up for my alcohol abstinence with my charmin' "
"good looks, great sense of humor, and lovable personality! Don't ya think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4124"
msgid "Hm, I'd say so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4136"
msgid "Alright, Kiryu-san, hear me out on this one..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4148"
msgid "I know I work at a place like this and all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4160"
msgid ""
"But I can't stand dealin' with old dudes. They need to just kick the bucket "
"already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4172"
msgid "You really don't like older men, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4184"
msgid ""
"Not at all! They make me wanna vomit up the contents of my stomach and then "
"some!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4196"
msgid "Errrgh! Just sittin' next to 'em gives me the creeps!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4208"
msgid ""
"Oh, but don't worry, Kiryu-san! You're in the safe zone... But only barely. "
"Hahahaha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4220"
msgid "So you prefer your men a little younger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4232"
msgid "Yeah, but only being young won't get ya very far with me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4244"
msgid ""
"I want someone with a real handsome face! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> After "
"all, that's what ya spend most of your time lookin' at, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4256"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "Giusta osservazione."

msgctxt "4268"
msgid ""
"Come to think of it, you got a pretty solid face, Kiryu-san! All them "
"straight lines n' sharp features..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4280"
msgid ""
"Don't take that to mean much⑬you ain't even close to being my type⑬yet you "
"don't give off any bad vibes, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4292"
msgid "Not sure what makes me say that, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4304"
msgid "That's... flattering..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4316"
msgid "Are you just being nice by saying I'm in the safe zone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4328"
msgid "Hah, you thought I was flatterin' ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4340"
msgid ""
"Trust me, \"barely in the safe zone\" ain't flattery, and if it was, I "
"wouldn't have said it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4352"
msgid ""
"Believe me, I ain't the type who tries to score points with people. That "
"sorta thing's a real pain in the ass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4364"
msgid "Yeah, I can tell..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4376"
msgid "You're pretty blunt, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4388"
msgid "Darn straight! I ain't made of sugar, so I don't sugarcoat the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4400"
msgid ""
"My style is to spice things up instead! Least that's what the people around "
"me say. Hahaha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4412"
msgid "Heh. Fair enough."
msgstr "Heheh. Ci sta."

msgctxt "4424"
msgid ""
"Ain't that how it's supposed to be, though? I mean, sure, you can butter "
"people up all ya want, but that's just gonna end up biting both parties in "
"the butt. Right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4436"
msgid "I suppose that has some merit to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4448"
msgid ""
"So you agree? Then it looks like we'll get along just fine. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4460"
msgid "Good, I was hoping we'd get along."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4472"
msgid ""
"So I was passin' by this elementary school in the afternoon, when I saw this"
" kiddo swingin' around on the monkey bars."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4484"
msgid ""
"Seein' that reminded me of back when I was a kid... I used to do that too. I"
" was actually pretty athletic, y'know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4496"
msgid "I can only imagine..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4508"
msgid ""
"Anyway, there was this kid at my school who couldn't do a reverse flip on "
"the bars."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4520"
msgid "So I used to tell him, \"You can do it!\" and try to cheer him on..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4532"
msgid "But he couldn't pull it off, no matter how many times he tried."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4544"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4556"
msgid "Instead, he'd get all sad and start wailing away..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4568"
msgid ""
"Then everyone would gather around him and tell him it was\r\n"
"fine... And one day, he decided his monkey bar days were\r\n"
"over, just like that. He got used to being doted on, see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4580"
msgid "That's too bad."
msgstr "Che peccato."

msgctxt "4592"
msgid ""
"I just can't respect that, ya know? Putting in all that work, only to give "
"up outta nowhere... It's a total waste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4604"
msgid ""
"But then everyone I tell this to is all like, \"Rin, that's too cold, give "
"the kid some credit...\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4616"
msgid ""
"I mean, I get that effort's important and all, but you gotta at least make "
"some progress in the end. Or else what's the point of all that hard work?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4628"
msgid "What's your take, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4640"
msgid "You should at least give him some credit. After all, he tried."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4652"
msgid "Besides, not everyone can achieve exactly what they want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4664"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "4676"
msgid ""
"That being said, giving up on yourself is the one of the worst things you "
"can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4688"
msgid "Mm, I getcha..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4700"
msgid ""
"I just think that more and more people these days put on a \"work face\" but"
" don't actually get \"work done.\" Y'know what I mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4712"
msgid "Are you talking about the people at your main job?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4724"
msgid "Well, yeah."
msgstr "Beh, sì."

msgctxt "4736"
msgid "I got no love for those losers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4748"
msgid ""
"It's like, if you can't get the proper results at the end of the day, then "
"what are you even doing in the first place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4760"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4772"
msgid "It's all about results, like what you said."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4784"
msgid "Go on..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4796"
msgid ""
"Well, the only way to reach your goal is to give it everything you've got. "
"But if you don't reach your goal at all, then how do you know your efforts "
"were worthwhile?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4808"
msgid ""
"That's a real good way to put it, Kiryu-san! Ya got the same line of "
"thinkin' as me! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4820"
msgid ""
"I just think that more and more people these days put on a \"work face\" but"
" don't actually get \"work done.\" Y'know what I mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4832"
msgid "Are you talking about the people at your main job?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4844"
msgid "Well, yeah."
msgstr "Beh, sì."

msgctxt "4856"
msgid "I got no love for those losers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4868"
msgid ""
"It's like, if you can't get the proper results at the end of the day, then "
"what are you even doing in the first place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4880"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4892"
msgid ""
"I think there's something to be respected about going to face a challenge, "
"regardless of the outcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4904"
msgid "Huh? Whaddya mean by that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4916"
msgid ""
"Well, not everything is designed to produce tangible results, even if you "
"give it your all. That's just not how this world works."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4928"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4940"
msgid ""
"Doesn't that mean putting in effort itself can be considered a virtue? It's "
"the commitment that counts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4952"
msgid "...You know somethin'? Ya might just have a point there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4964"
msgid "At the same time, I see where you're coming from, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4976"
msgid "Why, thank you. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Grazie. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

msgctxt "4988"
msgid ""
"I just think that more and more people these days put on a \"work face\" but"
" don't actually get \"work done.\" Y'know what I mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5000"
msgid "Are you talking about the people at your main job?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5012"
msgid "Well, yeah."
msgstr "Beh, sì."

msgctxt "5024"
msgid "I got no love for those losers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5036"
msgid ""
"It's like, if you can't get the proper results at the end of the day, then "
"what are you even doing in the first place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5048"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5060"
msgid "So I was wondering, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5072"
msgid "What about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5084"
msgid ""
"Do you get all aggressive when it comes to the woman ya like?\r\n"
"Or are ya the type who makes 'em fall for you instead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5096"
msgid "Hmm, now there's a question..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5108"
msgid "Personally, I can't say much on the topic..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5120"
msgid ""
"Ah, who am I kiddin'? When I like a guy, I get so flustered, I can barely "
"look him in the eyes, let alone make the first move. At the same time, I "
"hate when they're too aggressive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5132"
msgid ""
"Okay. Then, if you were to approach a guy you liked, how would you do it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5144"
msgid ""
"Mmm... Okay, so, after meeting up and exchanging contact info, I'd start "
"sending him a flood of emails. On a daily basis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5156"
msgid "You would?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5168"
msgid "Yep! I'll drop a load of juicy Rin-formation for him to devour!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5180"
msgid ""
"That way he can get some hints about how he needs to talk to me the next "
"time we meet up. Expedites the whole process!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5192"
msgid "That makes sense."
msgstr "Ha senso."

msgctxt "5204"
msgid ""
"Hehe, nice strategy, right? Helps me reel in the bait!\r\n"
"...Most of the time, anyway. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5216"
msgid "I didn't realize ladies could be so cunning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5228"
msgid ""
"Hehe, you have no idea. Any woman with half an inkling of\r\n"
"who she is can handle a man like clockwork."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5240"
msgid "Then I'd better \"watch\" out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5252"
msgid "What would be in those emails?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5264"
msgid ""
"Well, I'd start off by makin' simple conversation. That's my opening attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5276"
msgid ""
"And then, little by little, I'd start weaving in tidbits of personal info..."
" Hobbies I'm into, places I wanna go... That sorta thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5288"
msgid ""
"If I told 'em everything upfront, they'd get scared from the get-go, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5300"
msgid ""
"As such, I devised a more gradual infiltration method. Makes it seem casual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5312"
msgid "That's a pretty detailed strategy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5324"
msgid "Can you email me every day too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5336"
msgid "Eh? Come again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5348"
msgid "I'd like to know some Rin-formation, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5360"
msgid "Nope, no can do. We ain't that close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5372"
msgid ""
"Ya might be tryin' to pass that off as a joke, but that one\r\n"
"fell flat as a busted tire, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5384"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5396"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, I'm gonna guess your height is either at or around... oh, I'd "
"say... 180 centimeters?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5408"
msgid "That's pretty close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5420"
msgid "Good!"
msgstr "Bene!"

msgctxt "5432"
msgid "A guy's gotta be tall and imposing, y'know? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5444"
msgid "In order to meet your criteria?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5456"
msgid ""
"Yup. I'm short as heck, so I've been lookin' up to tall guys my whole life. "
"Literally!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5468"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "5480"
msgid ""
"Now if only your face was as cute as those half or quarter-Japanese guys... "
"You'd be a real pretty boy, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5492"
msgid ""
"I might even fall for ya before I could stop the wheels of love from "
"spinning. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5504"
msgid "Heh. Okay then."
msgstr "Eheh. D'accordo, allora."

msgctxt "5516"
msgid "So what you look for in a man, as far as personality goes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5528"
msgid ""
"To be honest, I don't have a particular \"type,\" if that's what you're "
"askin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5540"
msgid ""
"As long as he's tall, ripped, and steamy... enough to make me melt on the "
"spot. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5552"
msgid ""
"After all, that's the ideal image of a man, at least the way I see it. Guys "
"like that can get a woman any time they please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5564"
msgid ""
"Even if they are a little bit of a bad boy. ♪ That don't bother me either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5576"
msgid "Sounds logical."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5588"
msgid "Ain't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5600"
msgid ""
"Besides, who would go through the trouble of tryin' to figure out someone's "
"personality before ya even got to know 'em? That's just slappin' labels on "
"people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5612"
msgid ""
"Not to mention, people change over time. So whatever time ya spent trying to"
" figure 'em out is just gonna be wasted anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5624"
msgid "Yeah, I guess you're right."
msgstr "Già, immagino tu abbia ragione."

msgctxt "5636"
msgid "Hahaha. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Looks like we see eye to eye, then!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5648"
msgid "Isn't personality more important than looks?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5660"
msgid "Well yeah, that's what you're \"supposed\" to say..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5672"
msgid ""
"But if your personalities don't match, then it's pretty much over from the "
"start."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5684"
msgid ""
"Okay, but you gotta go out with 'em for a while to actually "
"<Italic>know</Italic> you're not a good match. Right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5696"
msgid ""
"I mean, who wants to get all tangled up in assumptions right from the "
"beginning?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5708"
msgid "...You do have a point there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5720"
msgid "Guess that rules me out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5732"
msgid "You saying you ain't my type?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5744"
msgid "Sure doesn't seem like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5756"
msgid "Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait! Don't rule yourself out just yet..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5768"
msgid ""
"I mean, you're tall... Tough-lookin'... Built like a brick oven, as a matter"
" of fact..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5780"
msgid ""
"And sure, your personality's way different than what I'm normally used to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5792"
msgid ""
"But if we're talkin' hypotheticals here, who knows? We might make a pretty "
"decent couple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5804"
msgid "You're just trying to make me feel better, aren't you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5816"
msgid "Heck no, I'm being serious here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5828"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5840"
msgid "Hey. You probably think I'm just some regular ol' hostess gal, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5852"
msgid "Well what if I told you I was pretty darn good at computers? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5864"
msgid "You are?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "5876"
msgid ""
"You bet! I can type lightning-fast without even lookin' at the keyboard! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5888"
msgid "Only thing is, these nails... You see how they are?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5900"
msgid ""
"They keep clackin' away and wearin' down my keyboard... to the point where "
"it's totally illegible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5912"
msgid ""
"There was this time when my coworker had to use my computer... And when he "
"saw that not a single letter remained, ya know what he said?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5924"
msgid "\"How in the heck do you type on this thing!?\" Dude was flabbergasted! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5936"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "5948"
msgid ""
"What can I say? I'm always typin' up a storm wherever I go. That's why I got"
" me a laptop. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5960"
msgid "What do you do on that laptop of yours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5972"
msgid ""
"Oh, you know, basic stuff... Update my homepage, search for stuff I need, "
"email, blog... All that nonsense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5984"
msgid ""
"Wait, why did I start with the beginner-level stuff!? I should've mentioned "
"all the complicated things first in order to baffle and blow your mind!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5996"
msgid ""
"...Not that you'd understand it anyway, ya big caveman!\r\n"
"Ahahahahaha! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6008"
msgid "What if I told you this big caveman had a blog of his own?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6020"
msgid ""
"Hah! Well that's a laugh! You're a real riot, you know that? "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6032"
msgid "Am I...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6044"
msgid "Huh, never would've guessed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6056"
msgid "Right? I'm even impressed myself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6068"
msgid ""
"I think it's the contrast that gives a person depth. Like, my nails might be"
" all glam and glitter, but my brain's always open for business! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6080"
msgid "That's an impressive statement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6092"
msgid ""
"Ahaha! ♪ Don't go praisin' me for somethin' so random! ♪ You're gonna "
"inflate my ego like a balloon... and then it might go \"pop!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6104"
msgid ""
"Even so, I think you should be proud of yourself for mastering a skill. "
"Especially a difficult one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6116"
msgid ""
"Aww... You got me blushing like a schoolgirl now... Look what ya did! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6128"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "6140"
msgid "I've never touched a computer in my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6152"
msgid "No way. How's that even possible in this day and age!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6164"
msgid "Not sure. I've never really needed one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6176"
msgid ""
"No kiddin'... Well, guess there's no reason to have one if ya don't need "
"one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6188"
msgid ""
"But in my case, I can't get anything done without one!\r\n"
"I'm pretty much stuck in the technology world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6200"
msgid "Seems like that's not such a bad place to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6212"
msgid "Ooh. I think I ate too much..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6224"
msgid "Feeling all right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6236"
msgid ""
"I was when I was eatin'. My mama's omurice is just so good,\r\n"
"I couldn't stop myself from gorging away..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6248"
msgid "...Now I'm payin' the price for scarfin' it all down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6260"
msgid "It was that good, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6272"
msgid ""
"You bet it was! There ain't nothing better than my mama's home cookin'!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6284"
msgid "Mind if I try it sometime?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6296"
msgid "Hahaha, I'd love to have ya try it. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6308"
msgid "Ah! Unfortunately, that ain't possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6320"
msgid "Why is that?"
msgstr "Perché?"

msgctxt "6332"
msgid ""
"Well, if my folks woke up one day and saw ya munchin' away in their kitchen,"
" they'd probably flip their lids!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6344"
msgid "You could always tell them beforehand..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6356"
msgid ""
"Hahaha, I was just messin' with ya! They're pretty mellow,\r\n"
" actually. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6368"
msgid ""
"But you might be the one who gets scared off, Kiryu-san. So that's a no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6380"
msgid "Sorry 'bout that! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6392"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6404"
msgid "Can you make omurice too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6416"
msgid "Huh? Is that a serious question?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6428"
msgid ""
"...Nrgh. I'd love to say I can, but unfortunately, the only\r\n"
"thing I make in the kitchen is an absolute clusterfail mess.\r\n"
"Ahaha... ha..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6440"
msgid "...I see."
msgstr "...Capisco."

msgctxt "6452"
msgid "What, does that disappoint you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6464"
msgid ""
"Oh, is it 'cause you were expecting me to cook for ya!? 'Cause, I mean, I "
"can still give it a try! Even though it's guaranteed to taste like burnt "
"rocks..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6476"
msgid "Well, no matter how how it turns out, I still want to try it sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6488"
msgid ""
"Hehe, then I guess I'll start workin' on my cookin'! Just for you! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6500"
msgid ""
"You should throw it up in the bathroom. Like after a long night of drinking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6512"
msgid "...Eww! Why would ya even suggest that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6524"
msgid ""
"For one, I just ate it, so it'd be a total waste to hack it right back up..."
" On top of that being freakin' disgusting..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6536"
msgid "But you said you weren't feeling well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6548"
msgid "Don't you worry about me now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6560"
msgid ""
"How about you sit back, take a nice, long, deep breath, and enjoy your drink"
" instead? Got it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6572"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Va bene..."

msgctxt "6584"
msgid ""
"Maaaaaaan! I wanna do some karaoke all of a sudden. Haven't done that in "
"forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6596"
msgid "When was the last time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6608"
msgid "Uh... Three days ago?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6620"
msgid "Only three days?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6632"
msgid ""
"Yup! Ain't nothin' better than having a room all to yourself so you can sing"
" your heart out! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6644"
msgid "I practically make it a ritual to sing at least three days a week!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6656"
msgid "Wow... That's a lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6668"
msgid ""
"I was thinkin' I should go after work... Then I could get even more singin' "
"in!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6680"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6692"
msgid ""
"While we're on the topic, don't you think singin' closes the gap between "
"people?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6704"
msgid "Like..."
msgstr "Cioè..."

msgctxt "6716"
msgid ""
"If you wanna get close to a good-looking guy without comin'\r\n"
"on too strong, karaoke's the way to do it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6728"
msgid "I'm honestly not a big fan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6740"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "6752"
msgid "What kinda answer is that!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6764"
msgid "You gotta go with the flow here, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6776"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "6788"
msgid "Whaddya mean, \"What do you mean\"!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6800"
msgid ""
"Okay, so our conversation literally went like this:\r\n"
"\"I love karaoke\" → \"Well, I don't\" → \"Oh, okay\" → End!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6812"
msgid "Keep talkin' like this and your conversations will go nowhere fast!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6824"
msgid "I mean, you do go to hostess clubs to talk it up, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6836"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "Già..."

msgctxt "6848"
msgid ""
"You sure are an odd one, Kiryu-san... But I guess ya got your own kinda "
"charm, huh? I guess that's cool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6860"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6872"
msgid "I can enjoy some karaoke."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6884"
msgid ""
"Is that right? I never would've pegged you as anything but tone deaf..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6896"
msgid "Well, how often do ya go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6908"
msgid "Something like once every three months..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6920"
msgid "Whaaaat! That's nothin'!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6932"
msgid "That ain't much different than not going, period!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6944"
msgid "You think so...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6956"
msgid "Want to go together then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6968"
msgid "Aha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6980"
msgid "Finally, the man invites me! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6992"
msgid "So. Finally decided to take things a step further, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7004"
msgid "Something like that."
msgstr "Qualcosa del genere."

msgctxt "7016"
msgid "Teeheehee... Ahahahaha! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7028"
msgid "You're a real honest guy, you know that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7040"
msgid "You were even turnin' a little red when ya said it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7052"
msgid "I was...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7064"
msgid ""
"Hehe, yup! Well, now that that's decided... all we have to do is set a date!"
" Once you gain a liiiiittle more of my trust, that is. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7076"
msgid "Uh-huh..."
msgstr "Uh-uh..."

msgctxt "7088"
msgid ""
"So my office had this competition where each employee would submit ideas for"
" a project, and mine won!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7100"
msgid "Nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7112"
msgid ""
"And wouldn't you know it, the president said he'd give me a bonus on top of "
"it! If that ain't the coolest day ever, then I don't know what is! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7124"
msgid "I'm happy for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7136"
msgid "Hehe. Am I amazing or what? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7148"
msgid "Speaking of which, what do you do for work?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7160"
msgid "Huh? Didn't I tell ya already? Ah, it's no biggie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7172"
msgid "I work in sales at... well, it's pretty much a fashion company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7184"
msgid "That seems to fit you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7196"
msgid ""
"Yeah, and get this. For that contest? I totally forgot about the deadline "
"for submission..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7208"
msgid ""
"So I whipped up some documents in the span of two hours⑬real professional-"
"like, might I add⑬and that's what got picked! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7220"
msgid ""
"My coworkers who stayed up all night workin' on their garbage ideas were "
"super jealous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7232"
msgid "Not much I can do about that, though! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7244"
msgid "That's pretty impressive."
msgstr "Wow. Mica male!"

msgctxt "7256"
msgid "Don't stroke my ego too much now, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7268"
msgid ""
"Otherwise I'll end up struttin' around like an overgrown chicken, and ya "
"wouldn't want that, now would ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7280"
msgid "Heh. I wouldn't have a problem with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7292"
msgid "What kind of idea was it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7304"
msgid "I'll tell ya if you're reeeeeally interested."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7316"
msgid "Don't worry, I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7328"
msgid "Okay! So my idea was... yukatas with a modern twist!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7340"
msgid ""
"I designed 'em with a daily life aesthetic in mind. Basically, what would a "
"yukata be like if it was designed in the modern day?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7352"
msgid "Oh, so you're a designer, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7364"
msgid "Yup. Always have been somethin' of a creative type. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7376"
msgid "Wow. Is there anything you don't do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7388"
msgid "Oh, come on! I ain't that special... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7400"
msgid "Don't sell yourself short."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7412"
msgid "What exactly do you do in sales?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7424"
msgid ""
"It's in the name, man. We determine how our products are sold. It's the same"
" job across, like, every single business out there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7436"
msgid ""
"I'm only familiar with a certain kind of business... and it's probably not "
"what you're thinking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7448"
msgid "Okay, well... Have you ever heard of the three \"P's\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7460"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7472"
msgid ""
"\"Product, Pricing, and Planning.\" Distribution planning, to be more "
"precise. Ya really never heard of this before?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7484"
msgid "I... think I'm starting to get it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7496"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, remember on our after-hours date, there was that guy who came up "
"to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7508"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "Già..."

msgctxt "7520"
msgid "I should let ya know... He's my ex."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7532"
msgid "What? That guy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7544"
msgid "Yeah. We broke up two years ago..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7556"
msgid "'Cause I ended up fallin' for someone way cuter! Ehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7568"
msgid "Just like that, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7580"
msgid "Well, I admit that I did kinda play him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7592"
msgid "But I can't date two guys at once. It just doesn't feel right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7604"
msgid "So I had to let one go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7616"
msgid "Yeah, I would hope so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7628"
msgid ""
"Thing is, my ex hasn't changed a bit over these last two years... Still the "
"bitter little worm he's always been."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7640"
msgid "How long were you two going out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7652"
msgid "Half a year."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7664"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "7676"
msgid "Well, do you regret breaking up with him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7688"
msgid "No. I honestly think it was all a matter of timing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7700"
msgid ""
"After all, as soon as I found another guy, I dumped him pretty quick. Guess "
"my ex kinda got shafted, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7712"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7724"
msgid "Maybe he still has trouble letting go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7736"
msgid ""
"Huh? Oh... For a second there, I thought ya said it was the other way "
"around..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7748"
msgid "No, I definitely meant him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7760"
msgid "It sounds like he still he has a thing for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7772"
msgid ""
"Haha, well, what can I say? Lots of my exes come crawling back to me with "
"stars in their eyes. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7784"
msgid "It's tough being a popular gal. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7796"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7808"
msgid "That's how you know he was a good guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7820"
msgid "I mean, he wasn't all that bad. He was cute, at least."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7832"
msgid "But I dunno. The rest of him...? Meh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7844"
msgid ""
"His perspective on life was just too boring. Guy might as well be livin' in "
"a coma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7856"
msgid "Can you give me an example?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7868"
msgid "I can't just come up with something on the spot..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7880"
msgid "Hmmmm..."
msgstr "Mmmm..."

msgctxt "7892"
msgid ""
"Oh! I got it! Maybe he was just so boring that I forgot everything about "
"him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7904"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7916"
msgid ""
"I got this friend who keeps tellin' me, \"If only I were as cute as you, "
"life would be so much better!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7928"
msgid "I dunno where she gets that. I really ain't that cute to begin with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7940"
msgid "You don't think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7952"
msgid ""
"Heck no! Any time I look something close to resembling cute, it's because I "
"put tons of work into it! My hair, my nails, my skin, my face... All that "
"takes massive time and energy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7964"
msgid "I don't just wake up and flip on the beauty switch, y'know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7976"
msgid ""
"Write this down, Kiryu-san! If you wanna be noticed, you gotta work hard on "
"your appearance! This goes for guys and girls alike!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7988"
msgid "You've got a point there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8000"
msgid ""
"Yeah! That's why I said you oughta write it down. Post it on your fridge or "
"somethin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8012"
msgid "Me, specifically?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8024"
msgid ""
"Of course! You're already pretty easy on the eyes, so you need to set the "
"example for others! Look the best you can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8036"
msgid "Remember, Kiryu-san... People notice more than you might think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8048"
msgid "Then I'd better be careful..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8060"
msgid "I guess I haven't worked hard enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8072"
msgid "Hmm, I wonder what makes ya say that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8084"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8096"
msgid ""
"Ahahaha! Look at that face! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> It's all scrunched up "
"like a shower cap... You don't have to think so hard around me, y'know!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8108"
msgid "Thanks... I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8120"
msgid ""
"Well then, let's start with that getup! First, ditch the suit. It's old. "
"It's dated. It's done for. Try for something a bit more hip with the times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8132"
msgid "But my suit's stuck with me for this long..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8144"
msgid "That's not necessary for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8156"
msgid "Oh? And what makes ya say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8168"
msgid "Simple. Men should let their backs do the talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8180"
msgid ""
"Wow... That's the first time I've ever heard someone actually say that... "
"other than in some yakuza B-movie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8192"
msgid "I was just messing around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8204"
msgid ""
"Either way, I don't think that \"angry, battleworn golfer\" look is really "
"workin' out for ya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8216"
msgid "Wouldn't it be better to change it up a little? Or heck, maybe a lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8228"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8240"
msgid "Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8252"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "Sì?"

msgctxt "8264"
msgid "Have you ever... struggled with something before?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8276"
msgid "...Plenty of times, actually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8288"
msgid "Yeah? 'Cause I haven't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8300"
msgid ""
"I don't really know why, but everything's been smooth sailing since "
"childhood. No big challenges, major setbacks, or whatever other sob stories "
"people ramble on about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8312"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8324"
msgid ""
"Things just work themselves out for me, y'know? So when people talk about "
"going through difficult times, I hate to say it, but I don't think I can "
"relate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8336"
msgid "That's not necessarily a bad thing."
msgstr "Non è necessariamente una cosa negativa."

msgctxt "8348"
msgid "Huh, you should tell my mama that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8360"
msgid ""
"\"You're gonna have to learn how to deal with life's problems someday!\" She"
" tells me this over and over. In all sorts of different variations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8372"
msgid "Maybe you've just been lucky so far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8384"
msgid "Mm... Guess I have had a fair bit of luck come my way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8396"
msgid ""
"Come to think of it, there's been some pretty close calls I just can't write"
" off as coincidence..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8408"
msgid ""
"I get this weird feeling, too... Restlessness? Uneasiness? I dunno what "
"you'd call it, but it's almost like fate itself is waiting... waiting for "
"its chance to punish me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8420"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8432"
msgid "That's because you're something of a genius."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8444"
msgid "No way. I ain't even close to being that smart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8456"
msgid ""
"Besides, what kinda jerk would I be to admit something like that, even if I "
"was?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8468"
msgid ""
"But you've never had to struggle at all. Isn't that a sign of extreme "
"intelligence?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8480"
msgid ""
"...Maybe. I am pretty good at planning things out, to the point where "
"everything goes my way eventually..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8492"
msgid ""
"Or it could be that I have a knack for whatever I've been doing up till now "
"and haven't been in a challenging situation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8504"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8516"
msgid ""
"But I've been gettin' these weird feelings lately... Like the gods are about"
" to punish me for coasting my way through life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8528"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8540"
msgid "Your mother's a wise woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8552"
msgid "Ya mean I should take her more seriously...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8564"
msgid ""
"Well, you may not realize it, but sometimes there are forces beyond your "
"control operating in the background that ultimately determine your success."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8576"
msgid ""
"Sometimes it's the people around you, sometimes it's the situation itself. "
"So I think your mother was trying to tell you to not get too arrogant with "
"life. Or it'll break you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8588"
msgid ""
"...Maybe so. Guess I could stand to show a little more gratitude from time "
"to time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8600"
msgid "Yes, you should."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8612"
msgid ""
"Hahaha. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Now that I hear it from you, Kiryu-san, I "
"feel a lot more convinced."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8624"
msgid ""
"And you're right. I'll start by expressing my gratitude to you... After all,"
" you're the one who's been requesting me all this time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8636"
msgid "Heh. You're welcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8648"
msgid "So I had this huuuuge argument with my coworker not too long ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8660"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "Che è successo?"

msgctxt "8672"
msgid "You really wanna know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8684"
msgid "Of course I do."
msgstr "Certo che lo penso."

msgctxt "8696"
msgid ""
"Alright, so there's this asshole who works in my department. Loves to talk "
"crap, like, all the time. I'm sure ya know the type. Anyway, he turns his "
"sights on me all of a sudden..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8708"
msgid ""
"He comes at me with, \"You need to read the situation better when it comes "
"to how you work.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8720"
msgid ""
"And, \"Not everyone's perfect like you, so it'd be better for the team if "
"you slowed down your pace to match theirs.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8732"
msgid ""
"His name's Takeshita, and I get why: 'cause he takes a shit on everyone he "
"sees!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8744"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8756"
msgid "And then he had the nerve to say this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8768"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe you think you can do your job better than me. But I know you. You're"
" just trying to make yourself look good!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8780"
msgid ""
"I mean, sure, I got myself a big ol' attitude, and I make it my duty to "
"never mince words. I'll admit that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8792"
msgid "That being said..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8804"
msgid ""
"I still work hard, and I do make an effort to respect the people around me. "
"I ain't some airheaded bimbo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8816"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "E di che."

msgctxt "8828"
msgid ""
"At this point, I'm way past being angry. I'm more in shock than anything... "
"Agh, just thinkin' about this is getting me down in the dumps!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8840"
msgid "You don't sound like yourself right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8852"
msgid "Huh...? Whaddya mean?"
msgstr "Eh? Che vuoi dire!?"

msgctxt "8864"
msgid ""
"The Rin I know would never be fazed by some random insult. What happened to "
"that spunky attitude of yours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8876"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8888"
msgid ""
"And don't worry about the last thing he said. People are taught to keep "
"their heads down to avoid generating conflict. But you're not like that. So "
"why not embrace it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8900"
msgid "...I appreciate you sayin' that, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8912"
msgid ""
"You're right. I ain't gonna solve anything just by mulling it over in my "
"head. I gotta embrace who I am and leave it at that. If anyone has a "
"problem, well, they can just shove it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8924"
msgid ""
"I knew talkin' to you would be the right decision. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8936"
msgid "Heh... I'm glad to hear that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8948"
msgid "Did you make him jealous somehow?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8960"
msgid "I don't see how that's possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8972"
msgid "I just do my job the way any paid employee should do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8984"
msgid "What right does anyone have to be jealous over that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8996"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9008"
msgid ""
"Or do I gotta drop my pace and be less efficient just so some idiot won't "
"get cheesed off?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9020"
msgid "Urgh, this whole situation is downright ridiculous!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9032"
msgid "It sure sounds ridiculous..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9044"
msgid ""
"Yeah... And I know venting all this anger at you isn't fair... But I just "
"can't seem to let this go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9056"
msgid ""
"Y'know what? Let's not talk about this anymore. It's just ruining our "
"valuable time together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9068"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9080"
msgid "I think he likes you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9092"
msgid "...Beg your pardon?"
msgstr "Prego?"

msgctxt "9104"
msgid ""
"Why else would he say such ridiculous things? It's obvious that he wants to "
"get your attention. He's just not good at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9116"
msgid "Ahahaha... That is ridiculous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9128"
msgid ""
"Even if that were the case, I'd pass him up in a heartbeat. Takeshita's a "
"total buttwipe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9140"
msgid "Yeah, he sure sounds like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9152"
msgid ""
"Y'know what? Let's not talk about this anymore. It's just ruining our "
"valuable time together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9164"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9176"
msgid "Remember how we talked about looks versus personality?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9188"
msgid "Well, I got to thinkin' lately... Something real profound."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9200"
msgid "Did you change your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9212"
msgid ""
"Not exactly. I still think appearance makes the bigger first impression."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9224"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "9236"
msgid "Ever since I got to know ya on a more person-to-person basis..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9248"
msgid ""
"I've started to think the way a person lives their life is real important "
"too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9260"
msgid "I'm glad you came to that realization."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9272"
msgid ""
"Don't get me wrong, either. I still think looks are important. But I've also"
" decided that what's inside a person counts just as much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9284"
msgid ""
"I guess what I'm saying is, the bar for my ideal man got raised a little "
"higher!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9296"
msgid "Heh... Higher and higher it goes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9308"
msgid "Don't \"heh\" me, Kiryu-san! This ain't no laughin' matter!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9320"
msgid ""
"If I set the bar too high, there won't be any guys left who can make the "
"jump!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9332"
msgid "Well? What're ya gonna do about it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9344"
msgid "I won't do a damn thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9356"
msgid "Hey... You don't gotta be so cold... Brrr..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9368"
msgid "Maybe I went a bit overboard, but what am I supposed to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9380"
msgid "Ain't that obvious?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9392"
msgid ""
"I basically just gave you the perfect opportunity to woo me, but I guess "
"that went right over your head."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9404"
msgid "...You did?"
msgstr "...Davvero?"

msgctxt "9416"
msgid "Hey. You thick in the head or somethin'? Or are ya just teasin' me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9428"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9440"
msgid "I'll take full responsibility."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9452"
msgid "Yeah? How?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9464"
msgid "I'll make you the happiest girl on the planet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9476"
msgid ""
"Wait just a minute! Don't you think you're moving a little too fast...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9488"
msgid "That was just the reaction I wanted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9500"
msgid "Ahhhhhh! You almost had me for a sec! Ahahaha... You big jerk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9512"
msgid "...Y'know, if you're gonna joke around, at least wear a smile."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9524"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9536"
msgid "There are still good guys out there. Don't worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9548"
msgid "Ya think so?"
msgstr "Pensi?"

msgctxt "9560"
msgid "Yeah. Nobody's going to leave a good woman like you alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9572"
msgid "Ahah! That's, like, super cliché, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9584"
msgid "Is it...?"
msgstr "Oggi è..."

msgctxt "9596"
msgid ""
"Hehe, it's all good. And who knows? Maybe it turns out the \"good guy\" I've"
" been waiting for... is right here in front of me. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9608"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9620"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san. When you go out on a date, do ya go with a particular destination"
" in mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9632"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "9644"
msgid "Don't think too hard now! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9656"
msgid ""
"Oho, so you do have somethin' in mind! It's written all over your face..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9668"
msgid "Okay. I think I'm gettin' a picture here. Tell me if I'm wrong!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9680"
msgid ""
"Depending on the girl you're with, you either start with drinks or go to a "
"nice, fancy restaurant. The whole wine n' dine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9692"
msgid ""
"Then ya take 'em to a club, probably not too different than this one. You'll"
" say it's either to spice things up or simmer things down, depending on what"
" she wants to hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9704"
msgid ""
"And before the night is over... she'll be dancin' in the palm of your hand! "
"Or your lap. But yeah! Sound accurate?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9716"
msgid "Heh... Would you like to find out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9728"
msgid ""
"What kinda response is that! I dunno whether you're tryin' to be subtle or "
"just plain creepy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9740"
msgid ""
"Well, you mentioned a lot of outlandish things just now, so I thought I'd "
"roll with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9752"
msgid "So what're ya saying? My idea of a date's outlandish?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9764"
msgid "I don't think I mentioned anything too crazy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9776"
msgid "...Can we start this conversation over?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9788"
msgid ""
"Alright, alright, I'll break it down for ya! I asked if you had any good "
"date ideas, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9800"
msgid ""
"Sooo, you should've asked me in that manly voice of yours, \"Don't you have "
"any good date ideas?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9812"
msgid "...Or somethin' like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9824"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Va bene..."

msgctxt "9836"
msgid "Fine! You really do need everything spelled out, don't ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9848"
msgid "For my dates it goes like this: First, we do karaoke! No exceptions!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9860"
msgid ""
"The rest of it goes like this: Karaoke → Movies → Food!\r\n"
"That's a standard date for yours truly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9872"
msgid "Sounds like a good routine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9884"
msgid "Ain't it? It's the standard of standards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9896"
msgid ""
"Too bad my ex wasn't on board, though. If he'd just listened to me, he "
"would've lived an amazing life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9908"
msgid "What was his issue?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9920"
msgid "Ah, he just didn't like karaoke. For whatever reason."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9932"
msgid ""
"He was always whinin' how he couldn't sing this, didn't know the words to "
"that, and blah blibbity blah blah blah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9944"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9956"
msgid "Drinking's not included?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9968"
msgid "Huh? Heck no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9980"
msgid "Oh, right. You're not a drinker."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9992"
msgid ""
"Sheez, can't believe ya asked me that even though you already knew I can't "
"drink..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10004"
msgid "...My mistake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10016"
msgid ""
"*sigh* No, that's just how it is. I know men just looooove alcohol. But no "
"matter how hard I try, I just can't stomach the stuff..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10028"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10040"
msgid "Shouldn't karaoke be last?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10052"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "Mh?"

msgctxt "10064"
msgid ""
"Wouldn't you normally go see a movie first? Followed by dinner and then "
"karaoke after hours, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10076"
msgid ""
"No way! You gotta go with your favorite first. And in my case, that's "
"karaoke."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10088"
msgid ""
"Life's short, y'know. No sense in delaying gratification. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10100"
msgid "Heh, you sure about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10112"
msgid "I mean, what you said makes sense..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10124"
msgid "And sure, maybe my way's different than other folks..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10136"
msgid ""
"But if you plan on takin' me out, Kiryu-san, I expect us to rush straight to"
" Karaokekan. No stops along the way! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10148"
msgid "Heh. Noted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10160"
msgid ""
"Hey, Kiryu-san. Say you're in a relationship. Are you the type that takes up"
" all the other person's time? Or does your time get taken up instead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10172"
msgid "Is there a difference?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10184"
msgid ""
"Okay, so, whenever I find myself entering romance mode, I wanna spend as "
"much time as possible with that special someone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10196"
msgid ""
"But I know some people might think that's annoying. Clingy. Suffocating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10208"
msgid "So I gotta get a good feel for the guy I'm going out with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10220"
msgid "See if they won't get turned off by that, y'know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10232"
msgid ""
"So! Back to the question! When you're in a relationship, do you let your "
"partner tie you down? Or are you the one doing the tying?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10244"
msgid "I usually do the tying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10256"
msgid "Get outta here! You for real?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10268"
msgid ""
"Yeah. In fact, I might end up spending all the time I have on my significant"
" other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10280"
msgid "Haha... I do get this warm, affectionate kinda vibe from ya, somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10292"
msgid "In fact, I bet you'd tie your partner down real tight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10304"
msgid "Why is that?"
msgstr "Perché?"

msgctxt "10316"
msgid "'Cause you look like the type who ties someone down with a rope! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10328"
msgid "Heh... I wouldn't go that far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10340"
msgid ""
"With all the things I'm involved in, I'd probably be the one who feels tied "
"down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10352"
msgid "Hah. That supposed to impress me? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10364"
msgid "Maybe."
msgstr "Forse."

msgctxt "10376"
msgid ""
"Well, took ya long enough. I actually am impressed. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> But only just a little."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10388"
msgid ""
"Anyway, did you know guys who feel like their partner's too clingy are more "
"likely to cheat? I read it in a ladies' mag, so that means it must be true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10400"
msgid ""
"Don't go breakin' too many hearts now, Kiryu-san... or yours might get "
"broken instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10412"
msgid "Look who's talking..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10424"
msgid "Are you asking this because you like me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10436"
msgid "Hm? Beg your pardon?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10448"
msgid ""
"You seem to be investigating me quite thoroughly. And that's what you do "
"when you're interested in a guy. You've said as much before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10460"
msgid "Hey, don't ya think you're misinterpreting things...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10472"
msgid "Then why all the questions?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10484"
msgid "I was just making conversation! We're talkin' hypotheticals here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10496"
msgid "Really? Because your eyes tell a different story."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10508"
msgid ""
"Geez... You just had to go and say something sexy... "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10520"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10532"
msgid "Waaargh! Owwie oww owwww..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10544"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "10556"
msgid "Nothing! ...Other than the fact my thighs are killin' me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10568"
msgid "Did you hurt yourself somehow?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10580"
msgid ""
"Haha, no. ♪ I was just riding a unicycle. Haven't done that in forever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10592"
msgid "You have a unicycle?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10604"
msgid ""
"Yup yup. And despite this slender feminine frame, I can balance myself like "
"a pro!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10616"
msgid "That's rad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10628"
msgid ""
"Oh, and technically the unicycle's not mine. It belongs to my niece. She got"
" one for her birthday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10640"
msgid "Sweet little anecdote, right? Well, here comes the sucky part..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10652"
msgid ""
"So I was watching my niece break in her new unicycle outside... Then my mama"
" came up to us. I could already tell from the look in her eyes, misfortune "
"was about to strike."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10664"
msgid ""
"Know what she did? She immediately went up to my niece and bragged about how"
" good I am at balancing on a unicycle for whatever godforsaken reason!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10676"
msgid ""
"So, of course I had to go impress her by riding around till my thighs were "
"chafed raw! Arrrgh... If only Mama'd kept out of it, I wouldn't be limpin' "
"around here like a dang zombie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10688"
msgid "Heh. Poor you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10700"
msgid ""
"And if that ain't enough, tomorrow I'm on babysitting duty... So it's gonna "
"be unicycle hell all over again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10712"
msgid "...Huh. A thought just occurred to me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10724"
msgid ""
"What would a normal customer think after hearing my thighs hurt from "
"straddling a unicycle all day? ...Not that I mean you're not normal or "
"anything. Just go along with me here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10736"
msgid "I'd honestly be turned off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10748"
msgid "Haha, yeah. What guy would care about that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10760"
msgid "They'd probably wanna hear about me ridin' something else, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10772"
msgid "Hey, I never said anything like that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10784"
msgid "Aha! Was that a smile just now, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10796"
msgid "You were about to compliment my superior sense of humor, weren't ya!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10808"
msgid "...I never said that either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10820"
msgid "Drop the act. I know why your thighs really hurt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10832"
msgid "Excuse me...?"
msgstr "Scusi..."

msgctxt "10844"
msgid ""
"Come on. You can tell me the truth. It wasn't really a unicycle, was it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10856"
msgid ""
"What kinda nonsense is bubbling up in that thick, Neanderthal head of yours?"
" I practically opened up my life to you, and here you are being a dirty old "
"man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10868"
msgid "Gimme a break..."
msgstr "Dammi un taglio..."

msgctxt "10880"
msgid "And make that the last time you \"go there\" without my consent. We clear?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10892"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10904"
msgid "You should let me ride it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10916"
msgid "Ehh? Ya wanna ride my unicycle?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10928"
msgid "Yeah... I've always wanted to try that out. To test myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10940"
msgid ""
"...Aha...Ahahaha...AHAHAHA! You? On a unicycle!? Well, if that ain't the "
"funniest thing I ever heard, then I dunno what is!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10952"
msgid ""
"I'd totally pay to see that, though! Would ya go up a little ramp, too? "
"Maybe stick out your arms like an airplane? Ahaha! Oh, stop it, Rin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10964"
msgid "I wasn't trying to be funny here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10976"
msgid "*sigh* I don't wanna go to work tomorrow..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10988"
msgid "Something wrong?"
msgstr "Qualcosa non va?"

msgctxt "11000"
msgid ""
"Well, I gotta \"entertain\" some clients for the bosses over dinner and "
"drinks. And that ain't what I signed up for!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11012"
msgid "Isn't entertaining clients supposed to be your thing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11024"
msgid "Not at my frickin' day job!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11036"
msgid ""
"I mean, what's the point of kissing ass, drinking till you're sick, and "
"harassing your female employees?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11048"
msgid ""
"That stuff just don't belong in the corporate world. Or any part of the "
"world, s'far as I'm concerned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11060"
msgid "Can't you just refuse?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11072"
msgid "Oh believe me, I intend to!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11084"
msgid "...Unfortunately, it ain't always that easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11096"
msgid "I can imagine..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11108"
msgid "They say entertaining clients is a \"job to get a job\"..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11120"
msgid ""
"Now, if all it consisted of was old dudes tellin' each other corny dad "
"jokes? Sure. Maybe I could tolerate that. But when they expect you to laugh "
"at that crap? Yeah, forget that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11132"
msgid "...And that's just the tip of the iceberg."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11144"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11156"
msgid "Unfortunately, it's part of the job. Welcome to the working world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11168"
msgid "*sigh* That's exactly what everyone else at the office says."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11180"
msgid "Maybe you should listen to them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11192"
msgid ""
"As if! I don't care if people perceive it as some kinda \"business best "
"practice\"! If it's not in my job description, I ain't having it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11204"
msgid ""
"...You're probably just gonna scold me no matter what I say, aren't ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11216"
msgid "No, I hear you. Trust me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11228"
msgid ""
"Well, whatever! I don't have the mental programming to go against what I "
"believe! My days as a corporate jester are over!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11240"
msgid "...Not to mention I get paid way better to entertain people here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11252"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11264"
msgid "I understand how you feel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11276"
msgid "You do?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "11288"
msgid ""
"Yeah. But, at the same time, it's important to know when you need to "
"separate your feelings from your duties and take one for the team."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11300"
msgid ""
"...I guess you're right. That always ends up being the point of compromise "
"for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11312"
msgid ""
"If I can stay quiet, put on a smile, and leave it at that,\r\n"
"then maybe... MAYBE I can put up with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11324"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "Bene."

msgctxt "11336"
msgid ""
"Whew. I feel like a bit of weight's been lifted offa me. Thanks, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11348"
msgid "My pleasure."
msgstr "È un piacere."

msgctxt "11360"
msgid "Oh yeah, so I went to Kyushu on a business trip not too long ago..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11372"
msgid "Kyushu, huh? Now that's a ways away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11384"
msgid ""
"You bet your left buttcheek it is. All those trains and transfers... at "
"least our client booked us a hotel. Nice gesture, one might think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11396"
msgid ""
"And when I got there, I was satisfied... at least when I saw the lobby. It "
"was when I got to the room that I finally noticed... the issue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11408"
msgid "What issue was that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11420"
msgid ""
"Allow me to preface the story by saying I had a feeling it would happen. "
"Maybe I'm some kinda clairvoyant or something. Anyway, ya ready for the big "
"reveal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11432"
msgid "My room... turned out... to have... two beds... instead of one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11444"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11456"
msgid ""
"I mean, two beds for only one lady!? Puh-lease! And since this place was way"
" out in the sticks, that just made the room feel even more awkward and "
"empty!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11468"
msgid ""
"Imagine! A sweet little gal like me, stuck in a giant room, way out in the "
"middle of nowhere, with nothing but two empty sleep-coffins for company! "
"That just ain't right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11480"
msgid "Why are you so unhappy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11492"
msgid ""
"Why am I unhappy!? What're ya tryin' to say, that sleeping by your lonesome "
"in a bedroom made for two ain't the saddest experience you can think of?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11504"
msgid "I can think of plenty of worse situations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11516"
msgid ""
"But... What about in the middle of the night... Ya roll over on your side..."
" and there's this other bed starin' back at you, like a... a rectangular, "
"mattressy intruder?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11528"
msgid "Hmm... I'm trying to find a reason I would care."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11540"
msgid ""
"Come on! Wouldn't staring at that empty bed make it feel like... I dunno, "
"like you went there on a romantic getaway but your partner up and left you, "
"so now you're all alone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11552"
msgid "That's how you see it? You have quite the imagination."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11564"
msgid "You're kiddin' me! That's totally how any girl would feel!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11576"
msgid ""
"Us ladies are sensitive to these things. Better make a note of that, Kiryu-"
"san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11588"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11600"
msgid "You should've had them switch your room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11612"
msgid "Oh. Well. I guess I totally could have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11624"
msgid ""
"But since our client reserved it specifically for me, wouldn't that be kinda"
" rude?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11636"
msgid "True. I hadn't considered that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11648"
msgid ""
"And to be quite honest, having a twin-bed room alone is ten times better "
"than shacking up with someone else. Who wants to hear someone snorin' the "
"night way, y'know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11660"
msgid "Then I guess that was the best option."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11672"
msgid ""
"Yeah, maybe. But still... Ain't it kinda awkward having an extra bed lyin' "
"around?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11684"
msgid "Gah, I just can't wrap my head around it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11696"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11708"
msgid "You could've connected the beds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11720"
msgid "...Say what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11732"
msgid ""
"If you had connected the beds into one, you could have spread out and "
"indulged yourself like a queen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11744"
msgid "Ahahaha! Dang, I shoulda thought of that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11756"
msgid ""
"But don't ya think that's a bit silly? Draggin' and pushin' a hotel bed "
"around..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11768"
msgid ""
"And just because you sleep on a queen size mattress doesn't make you a "
"queen... It's more like you're sleepin' on two court jesters, ham-sandwiched"
" together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11780"
msgid "...Sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11792"
msgid ""
"Also, don't ya think sleepin' on one big bed, all by your lonesome, is just "
"as sad and depressing as having an unoccupied bed in your room?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11804"
msgid "...Is there anything that isn't sad and depressing to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11816"
msgid "So I encountered something horrible the other day..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11828"
msgid ""
"A restaurant with some tasty-lookin' curry popped up near the office, so I "
"went over there on lunch, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11840"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Va bene..."

msgctxt "11852"
msgid "And yeah, the curry was definitely good, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11864"
msgid "The problem was their condiments!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11876"
msgid "What could have possibly gone wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11888"
msgid ""
"The rakkyo, Kiryu-san... You know those little scallion pickles? Well, I "
"find 'em to be disgusting!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11900"
msgid ""
"They look like giant teeth that fell out of a hippopotamus. And this curry "
"plate was loaded with 'em!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11912"
msgid "The moment I saw that, I knew it was my last time eatin' there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11924"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11936"
msgid "Ugh! Why does somethin' so nasty even exist in this world?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11948"
msgid "Then just don't eat it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11960"
msgid "Of course I ain't gonna eat that slimy excuse for sustenance!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11972"
msgid "Then what's the problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11984"
msgid ""
"Well, since they so graciously dumped an entire mountain of rakkyo on "
"there⑬without me asking⑬the curry was already drenched in pickle goo by the "
"time I picked 'em off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11996"
msgid ""
"Why don't they just put it on a separate plate? Or at least ask the customer"
" beforehand if they want any?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12008"
msgid "I mean, what kinda customer service is that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12020"
msgid "You must really hate the stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12032"
msgid "I'm more of a fukujinzuke fan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12044"
msgid ""
"Really!? Me too! When it comes to proper pickles, fukujinzuke's where it's "
"at! Not only does it match the taste of curry, it even matches the color!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12056"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

msgctxt "12068"
msgid ""
"Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You really know your comfort food, Kiryu-"
"san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12080"
msgid "Now, I hate to disappoint you, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12092"
msgid "But what?"
msgstr "Ma cosa?"

msgctxt "12104"
msgid "I do like rakkyo as well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12116"
msgid "Whaaaaaaat! Get outta heeeeeere!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12128"
msgid "...Seriously, which side are you on? Team Rakkyo or Team Fukujinzuke?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12140"
msgid "How about the team that can eat both? Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12152"
msgid "Rakkyo and curry go perfectly together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12164"
msgid "...Mmkay, this conversation has ended."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12176"
msgid ""
"You really should give it a chance. Rakkyo really does round out the flavor "
"of curry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12188"
msgid "Oh, is that right? Well, why didn't ya say so earlier!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12200"
msgid ""
"...Yeah right. I ain't touchin' that stuff. Unless ya got something else to "
"convince me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12212"
msgid "No, I think that's it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12224"
msgid "Good. Movin' along now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12236"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12248"
msgid ""
"So, the other day, I was using the computer at the office to whip up a few "
"documents..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12260"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Va bene..."

msgctxt "12272"
msgid ""
"And I was clatterin' away at the keyboard with my long, gorgeous nails..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12284"
msgid "Then suddenly, one of them snapped right off my finger!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12296"
msgid ""
"And wouldn't ya know it, it got stuck between the keys and... I dunno, "
"whatever's inside a keyboard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12308"
msgid ""
"So I'm sitting there, tryin' to dig my nail out... Meanwhile, the screen "
"keeps fillin' up with L's and O's. Just so happened my nail was stuck "
"between those two keys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12320"
msgid ""
"Now, I dunno which is worse: my document getting botched, my nail job "
"getting ruined, or the fact that my computer was literally laughin' at me by"
" repeating \"LOLOL\"!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12332"
msgid ""
"Actually, I do know what's worse. It's the nails. Definitely the nails."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12344"
msgid "Ahhh! It was the worst workday ever, Kiryu-san! Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12356"
msgid "Guess all you can do is laugh it off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12368"
msgid ""
"Haha, right? ♪ Wouldn't it be funny to walk up to someone's computer, only "
"to find a random little nail stickin' up outta their keyboard? It's like, "
"why is that even there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12380"
msgid "Heh. I guess that would be pretty funny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12392"
msgid ""
"Not to mention the message on my monitor. People would think I was nuts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12404"
msgid "So are you gonna take off your nails when you type from now on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12416"
msgid ""
"Whoa, just how little time you think it takes to apply these babies? Takes "
"damn near forever just to do one hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12428"
msgid ""
"Don't care if I end up hurting my fingers, or my keyboard, or the ears of "
"the person next to me. These li'l beauties are stayin' right where they "
"belong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12440"
msgid "Well... At least you're determined."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12452"
msgid "It's because of your bad habits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12464"
msgid "Hey! What's that supposed to mean!?"
msgstr "Che vorrebbe dire!?"

msgctxt "12476"
msgid "What you know about my habits, anyway..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12488"
msgid "Nothing, I'd wager!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12500"
msgid "I wasn't trying to offend you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12512"
msgid ""
"Hey. Laugh. That's what you're supposed to do when you're gettin' grilled. "
"Ever hear of lightening the mood?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12524"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12536"
msgid "Sounds like you had it pretty rough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12548"
msgid "Mm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12560"
msgid "Your nail situation..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12572"
msgid "Um."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12584"
msgid "Y'know, it's nice that you're concerned and all. Really. I mean that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12596"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12608"
msgid "Buuuuut... You should be laughin' with me instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12620"
msgid "I mean, think about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12632"
msgid ""
"I told ya this whole story 'bout how my nail got stuck in just the right "
"place..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12644"
msgid ""
"...And the computer was literally laughin' at me. Hilarious, right? That's "
"why you're supposed to laugh, ya big lummox!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12656"
msgid "Oh. Okay."
msgstr "Oh... Va bene."

msgctxt "12668"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Notice anything different?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12680"
msgid "Like what?"
msgstr "Ad esempio?"

msgctxt "12692"
msgid "Use your eyes, man! Don't tell me you don't see it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12704"
msgid "Oh? Maybe you got a new dress?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12716"
msgid "My dress is the same as always!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12728"
msgid "Then... Did you cut your hair?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12740"
msgid "Sheez! You really don't know!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12752"
msgid "...Sorry."
msgstr "S... scusa."

msgctxt "12764"
msgid "*sigh* You're hopeless sometimes, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12776"
msgid "My eyes! Take a look at my eyes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12788"
msgid "What about them?"
msgstr "E lui?"

msgctxt "12800"
msgid "...I give up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12812"
msgid "I changed my color contacts. Duh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12824"
msgid "Now that you mention it, they do look a little different..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12836"
msgid ""
"Different how? I want to know what <Italic>you</Italic> think! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12848"
msgid "Your new contacts look good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12860"
msgid "Do they really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12872"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "12884"
msgid "Yay! Then changing 'em up was the right call! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12896"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "12908"
msgid "...Ya know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12920"
msgid "Sometimes you're kinda slow on the uptake, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12932"
msgid "...Am I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12944"
msgid ""
"Well, I guess that's part of what makes you \"you.\" I can put up with that."
" ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12956"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12968"
msgid "Actually, they don't make much of a difference."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12980"
msgid "Hey! Why're ya backtracking all of a sudden?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12992"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13004"
msgid ""
"I changed up my contacts just because I wanted to make today special, "
"y'know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13016"
msgid "Even so, it's a little hard to notice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13028"
msgid "'Kay. I'll go change 'em back, then. It's obvious ya don't even care."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13040"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13052"
msgid "I didn't know you had bad vision."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13064"
msgid "Whuh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13076"
msgid "Well, you're wearing contacts because you can't see very well, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13088"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, they're <Italic>color</Italic> contacts, not prescription ones! "
"They're purely for cosmetic effect!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13100"
msgid "Oh... Now I get it."
msgstr "Eh... Adesso capisco."

msgctxt "13112"
msgid ""
"I mean, some color contacts are meant to do double duty... But not these "
"ones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13124"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "13136"
msgid ""
"Wait a minute, why am I lecturin' you about contacts in the first place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13148"
msgid "Heh, I guess it's okay. Today ya learned something new."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13160"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13172"
msgid "Alright, Kiryu-san, listen to this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13184"
msgid "Let me guess, someone screwed up somewhere?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13196"
msgid "Whaaaaat! ...How'd ya know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13208"
msgid "Just a feeling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13220"
msgid "Hehe. I guess I do kinda complain a lot, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13232"
msgid "Well, what can I say? People need to get with the program."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13244"
msgid "Heh..."
msgstr "Eh..."

msgctxt "13256"
msgid ""
"Anyway, this story's about a guy from my other job who got hired sometime "
"after me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13268"
msgid "...What was his name again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13280"
msgid "Huh, I forgot already. Oh well. Guess it's not that important."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13292"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13304"
msgid ""
"Let's just call him A-kun for now. So A-kun doesn't have much going for him "
"in the looks department, but man, does that guy know how to work "
"efficiently!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13316"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr "Uh."

msgctxt "13328"
msgid ""
"There's something oddly attractive about a man who knows how to get the job "
"done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13340"
msgid ""
"For a moment, I almost thought A-kun would be a pretty nice candidate... "
"emphasis on \"almost.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13352"
msgid "He must be a popular guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13364"
msgid "After all, a man has to be able to take care of his woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13376"
msgid ""
"Oh, most definitely. And the way he was holdin' three phones at once and "
"juggling three conversations without skippin' a beat?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13388"
msgid "Pinnacle of manliness right there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13400"
msgid "That does sound impressive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13412"
msgid ""
"Now if only A-kun's parents hadn't skipped over him when passing down the "
"good looks gene... I'd be all over that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13424"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, you seem like you'd be a good worker bee. Lemme guess, you're the"
" type who quietly gets things done without raising any kinda ruckus. Right? "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13436"
msgid "Heh, if you only knew..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13448"
msgid ""
"It's good to have contrast. You can't have all the good qualities at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13460"
msgid "Ooooooh, contrast. Yeah, that's a good way of lookin' at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13472"
msgid ""
"For example, when a woman who's normally short-tempered and prone to "
"constant complaining suddenly shows her intelligent side... It gives her a "
"layer of depth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13484"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13496"
msgid "...That supposed to be about me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13508"
msgid "No, that was... a person I made up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13520"
msgid "...Now I'm really sad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13532"
msgid "Just like that...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13544"
msgid "Would I be a nice candidate?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13556"
msgid "Uhhhh. No. And don't make that face at me, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13568"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13580"
msgid ""
"Besides, I don't even know what you're like on the job. That's important."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13592"
msgid ""
"Right now you're drinkin' and havin' fun. That's the only side to you I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13604"
msgid ""
"It's kinda hard to imagine you behind a desk, typin' up spreadsheets... "
"Yeah, I think I'll just stick to the Kiryu-san I know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13616"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13628"
msgid "So they were talkin' about blood types and whatnot on TV yesterday..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13640"
msgid "I'm type A, by the way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13652"
msgid ""
"Anyway, something they said about type-A people really stuck with me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13664"
msgid ""
"\"People with blood type A will strike a stone bridge to ensure safe "
"passage, but in doing so, they'll break it.\" Guess that means we're way too"
" cautious, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13676"
msgid "Heh. You must be pretty strong to break a stone bridge, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13688"
msgid "Hahaha! Kiryu-san, that's not the point at all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13700"
msgid "...But yeah. When I saw that on TV, I got kinda spooked..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13712"
msgid "I was like, \"Holy crap! I <Italic>am</Italic> super cautious!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13724"
msgid ""
"...As for how I'm gonna work on that? Well, I'll cross that bridge when I "
"come to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13736"
msgid "Anyhow. It's insane how I keep running into that bozo..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13748"
msgid "What bozo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13760"
msgid "My ex!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13772"
msgid "Oh, right."
msgstr "Ah, giusto..."

msgctxt "13784"
msgid ""
"I mean, what's up with that? Don't ya think there's something suspicious "
"goin' on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13796"
msgid "...You don't think he's followin' us, do ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13808"
msgid "I would hope not..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13820"
msgid "Okay, let's think about this for a sec."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13832"
msgid ""
"I only bump into him whenever I'm in Kamurocho⑬specifically, whenever I'm "
"with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13844"
msgid "That is true..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13856"
msgid "Aha! So something's definitely up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13868"
msgid ""
"Besides, this is a woman's intuition sorta thing. That's something you "
"should never ignore!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13880"
msgid "Maybe your meeting is fate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13892"
msgid "...Fate?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13904"
msgid ""
"Fate, as in, he and I are destined to be together? Like there's some greater"
" power at work?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13916"
msgid "...Is that what you're trying to say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13928"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13940"
msgid "Ewwwww!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13952"
msgid "No way, no how, no thank you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13964"
msgid "...Forget I said anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13976"
msgid ""
"Now I'm even more grossed out, Kiryu-san. For you of all people to suggest "
"it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13988"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14000"
msgid "I ever mention how the one thing I liked about my ex was his face?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14012"
msgid "Your face, on the other hand, is much more rough and rugged..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14024"
msgid "But you know what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14036"
msgid ""
"I'd much rather be staring at that scruffy mug of yours than anyone else's "
"right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14048"
msgid "I mean that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14060"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14072"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14084"
msgid "...You think maybe I'm just worrying too much?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14096"
msgid "It's possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14108"
msgid ""
"Even so, I'm still gonna interrogate that shady ex of mine the next time he "
"dares cross my path!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14120"
msgid "Hope he knows what's coming to him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14132"
msgid "That is concerning..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14144"
msgid "Ain't it? There can't be this many coincidences back to back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14156"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "Già..."

msgctxt "14168"
msgid "Alright, then I've come to a conclusion!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14180"
msgid "We need to decide on our next date. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14192"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "14204"
msgid "That way we can confirm whether he's stalkin' me, of course!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14216"
msgid "And if we do run into him again, it'll be a confirmation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14228"
msgid "Then I'll interrogate him right then and there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14240"
msgid ""
"And⑬here's the best part⑬if he tries something stupid, you can just beat him"
" down! Bam! Crack! Kapow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14252"
msgid "Hey now... Don't get any crazy ideas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14264"
msgid "Hahaha! Sorry. Couldn't help myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14276"
msgid "...Hey, you know something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14288"
msgid ""
"I realized just how fun it is having you around. ♪ Crazy how a dude like you"
" and a gal like me could get so close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14300"
msgid ""
"Now, I ain't exactly a fan of the whole \"big, hulking, tough guy\" "
"demeanor..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14312"
msgid "But you make me feel safe. And I appreciate that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14324"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14336"
msgid "Maybe there's a reason behind it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14348"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "14360"
msgid "You saying he's followin' us on purpose?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14372"
msgid "Yeah. Can you think of why that might be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14384"
msgid "...Nope. My mind's drawin' a complete blank."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14396"
msgid "I don't remember all that much about him, as you may know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14408"
msgid ""
"Gosh, why'd we even start dating in the first place...? It's like he got "
"written outta my memory!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14420"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14432"
msgid "...You know something, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14444"
msgid ""
"I feel a lot more close to ya these days. Like it's us against the world, or"
" something cool like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14456"
msgid "Just thought I'd let ya know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14468"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14480"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14492"
msgid "...You think maybe I'm just worrying too much?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14504"
msgid "It's possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14516"
msgid ""
"Even so, I'm still gonna interrogate that shady ex of mine the next time he "
"dares cross my path!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14528"
msgid "Hope he knows what's coming to him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14540"
msgid ""
"You know how there's more and more stuff on the news about people tryin' to "
"scam each other?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14552"
msgid "Things like fraud and embezzlement?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14564"
msgid "Yeah, that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14576"
msgid "I mean, how's that even happen in the first place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14588"
msgid "Think about it!"
msgstr "Pensaci."

msgctxt "14600"
msgid ""
"Even if you fleeced someone for 50 million yen, you're just gonna end up "
"gettin' caught. Then it's off to the slammer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14612"
msgid ""
"Living large for a little while ain't worth gettin' locked up till you're "
"old and dilapidated..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14624"
msgid "Agreed."
msgstr "Concordo."

msgctxt "14636"
msgid "Even if I lived a life of crime, I'd never do somethin' that stupid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14648"
msgid ""
"Besides, all I have to do is snag a guy who makes a cozy 20 mil. That's more"
" within my realm of possibility."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14660"
msgid "I figured you would say something like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14672"
msgid "Hey, you gotta keep your money legit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14684"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "14696"
msgid ""
"I'm sure there are plenty of good guys out there who pull in at least that "
"much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14708"
msgid "Yeah, and he's right here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14720"
msgid "Whaaaat!?"
msgstr "Cooosa!?"

msgctxt "14732"
msgid "...Kiryu-san. Let's get hitched. Right now. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14744"
msgid "I only said that to see how you'd react."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14756"
msgid "Aww, you just had to go and get my hopes up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14768"
msgid ""
"Well. Anyone who brags about their earnings so openly has gotta be, quite "
"frankly, a jackass. So I guess I'm not too disappointed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14780"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14792"
msgid ""
"But, at the same time, a guy's yearly salary needs to be taken into "
"consideration. It's, like, one of his most important stats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14804"
msgid ""
"And, for better or worse, society considers higher earners to be higher on "
"the social ladder. That's just how it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14816"
msgid "Maybe so."
msgstr "Forse..."

msgctxt "14828"
msgid ""
"Heh, and if one of these rich boys happens to be extremely handsome... I'd "
"spouse 'em up quick!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14840"
msgid ""
"Maybe I'll end up gettin' 20 mil all by myself... on the quest to find me a "
"hubby."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14852"
msgid "Heh. You never know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14864"
msgid ""
"You have to grow with your man. Or at least manipulate him into earning a "
"better salary, if that doesn't work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14876"
msgid ""
"Hah, there's that Kiryu-san humor! Dry as a bone, but hits you outta nowhere"
" like a boomerang!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14888"
msgid ""
"In all seriousness, though, I think the starting point of your salary "
"determines quite a bit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14900"
msgid ""
"Like, it'd be a long and difficult road ahead if a guy started with a measly"
" four mil. That's barely enough to cover living expenses here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14912"
msgid "That's true..."
msgstr "È vero..."

msgctxt "14924"
msgid "Eight million would be pretty adequate, though. I think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14936"
msgid ""
"Nah, I'd need at least ten mil to keep me comfortable... That way we can put"
" away some extra every check..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14948"
msgid "Hmmmmmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14960"
msgid ""
"Ahhh, I don't even care anymore! Maybe I should just go the safe route and "
"look for someone stable... Not too rich, but obviously not broke, either..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14972"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14984"
msgid "Time to get matchmaking, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14996"
msgid "What, you think I should go on one of those awful group dates?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15008"
msgid ""
"It doesn't have to be awful. And I'm sure you could find lots of decent men "
"within your desired salary range."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15020"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15032"
msgid "It doesn't hurt to try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15044"
msgid "You... You really think I should?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15056"
msgid "At least give it a shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15068"
msgid ""
"Uh-uh. No. Can't do it. I'm sorry! Well, no, I'm actually not, but still! "
"Forget that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15080"
msgid "They'll just end up using me for their own devious ends..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15092"
msgid "Not sure what you're so afraid of..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15104"
msgid "Remember that Takeshita guy from my office? Y'know, the mean guy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15116"
msgid "Yeah, what about him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15128"
msgid "He set me up, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15140"
msgid "He set you up? How?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15152"
msgid ""
"Doesn't matter! The important thing is, he had the gall to go behind my back"
" and make a fool of me in front of our most trusted clients... That self-"
"righteous backstabber!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15164"
msgid ""
"I oughta take these beautiful nails of mine and shove 'em straight up his "
"big, hairy nostrils..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15176"
msgid "Ah, who am I kidding... That'd just get my nails dirty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15188"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15200"
msgid "...Hey, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15212"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "Sì?"

msgctxt "15224"
msgid ""
"Remember what my mama said? That I needed to learn how to cope with life's "
"difficulties or some such sentiment?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15236"
msgid "I do recall something like that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15248"
msgid "Well? Did she mean something like this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15260"
msgid "That very well could be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15272"
msgid "Ahhhhhh, then what should I do...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15284"
msgid "Hey, cheer up. It can't be that bad, can it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15296"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15308"
msgid "...Well, even if it is, sulking doesn't suit you at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15320"
msgid ""
"But... I don't even know what suits me anymore. This whole thing's got my "
"brain scrambled!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15332"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15344"
msgid "Drink up and forget about it. That usually works for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15356"
msgid "So... I need to learn how to drink?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15368"
msgid "Huh... That never crossed my mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15380"
msgid ""
"Maybe you're right. Hard times call for hard liquor. That's pretty much the "
"whole point of alcohol."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15392"
msgid "...At this point, I'm almost willing to drink myself into a coma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15404"
msgid "Ahhh, but I just can't! Gah... I'm such a loser..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15416"
msgid "...Maybe I shouldn't have brought this up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15428"
msgid "Why don't we go have some fun right now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15440"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "15452"
msgid ""
"I know how much you like karaoke, so I thought it'd be nice if we could go "
"together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15464"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15476"
msgid ""
"The only thing is, I don't know what's popular right now. Guess you could "
"say I'm a little old-fashioned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15488"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15500"
msgid "That's... awful nice of ya to try and cheer me up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15512"
msgid ""
"Keep doing that and I... I seriously might fall for ya. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15524"
msgid "....."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15536"
msgid "I need to share something with ya, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15548"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "E cioè?"

msgctxt "15560"
msgid ""
"Remember what I said before? How I go for good-looking guys, even if their "
"personality stinks?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15572"
msgid "You did say something like that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15584"
msgid "Okay, well. To be perfectly honest with ya..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15596"
msgid "I just want to be needed, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15608"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15620"
msgid ""
"I realized that, deep down, I don't have a lot of confidence in myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15632"
msgid "And that might be the reason I'm always goin' after the bad boys..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15644"
msgid "...As if having a hot guy around's gonna boost my self-esteem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15656"
msgid "You really should be more confident."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15668"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15680"
msgid "I think you're a better woman than you might realize."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15692"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15704"
msgid "That don't solve a thing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15716"
msgid ""
"I can't just be confident 'cause someone tells me to be! It ain't that easy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15728"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15740"
msgid "And could ya not say something so generic next time? Geez!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15752"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15764"
msgid "I think you have plenty of self-esteem as it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15776"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15788"
msgid ""
"Look at all the effort you put into yourself. You wouldn't do all that if "
"you didn't value yourself, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15800"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15812"
msgid "<Color:Default>...Maybe so.<Color:7>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15824"
msgid ""
"Guess I've just been stuck in a rut and haven't mustered the strength to "
"unstick myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15836"
msgid "I know it can be hard, but you can do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15848"
msgid ""
"...Maybe I just have to be patient. Stop getting frustrated and confront the"
" situation calmly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15860"
msgid ""
"Otherwise I'll be doing myself a disservice. And the problem will only get "
"bigger and bigger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15872"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "15884"
msgid ""
"Okay! Then that's what I'll do! You're gonna see a whole new Rin emerge⑬more"
" beautiful, more powerful, and more mature than ever before!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15896"
msgid ""
"So I suggest you put your best moves on me before I skyrocket out of your "
"league. Just giving you a head's up! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15908"
msgid "Heh. Then I look forward to your transformation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15920"
msgid "That's because you're still young."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15932"
msgid "...Ya mind clarifyin' that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15944"
msgid ""
"Well, when I was young, I was constantly surrounded by pressure to do this "
"or that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15956"
msgid ""
"On top of that, when you're young, everything is new to you. You also don't "
"have as much experience to rely on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15968"
msgid "Yeah, I'm listening..."
msgstr "Sì, ti ascolto."

msgctxt "15980"
msgid ""
"However, the only way to build self-esteem is to fight through your "
"insecurities. That's the glue that holds your foundation together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15992"
msgid "...Ya know something? You're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16004"
msgid ""
"If only I'd realized that sooner... Maybe I wouldn't have had to try so "
"hard..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16016"
msgid "Haha, it's like you're my life coach or something, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16028"
msgid "But seriously. Thank you. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16040"
msgid "Anytime."
msgstr "Quando vuoi."

msgctxt "16052"
msgid ""
"So one of my friends actually wants to drag me along with her to a group "
"date."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16064"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "16076"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Girl straight-up told me I needed to get laid. Said that'd help me be "
"more motivated in life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16088"
msgid ""
"And hey, it ain't like she's wrong or anything... But that sounds like "
"somethin' I would say!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16100"
msgid "Hahaha! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16112"
msgid "I'm sure she's just trying to help you in her own way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16124"
msgid ""
"Yeah, well. I dunno how much help it really is. I totally suck at group "
"dates."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16136"
msgid "Passing utensils, handing out napkins, dumping food on plates..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16148"
msgid "Who in their right mind would find that exciting?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16160"
msgid ""
"Oh, and even worse, I don't drink. So all I end up doing is scarfin' down my"
" food in silence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16172"
msgid ""
"I mean, if someone strikes up a conversation with me, I'll try and make some"
" small talk, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16184"
msgid "But it's not really your thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16196"
msgid "Darn straight."
msgstr "Esattamente."

msgctxt "16208"
msgid ""
"But maybe, just maybe... I'll end up meeting some handsome heartthrob. "
"Wouldn't that be neat?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16220"
msgid "Plus, my friend did invite me, so I might as well check it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16232"
msgid "I just hope it doesn't suck too bad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16244"
msgid "You don't have to force yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16256"
msgid "So that's a no, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16268"
msgid ""
"Well, you seem like you're pretty against it. Might as well follow your "
"instincts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16280"
msgid "But then my friend would be disappointed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16292"
msgid ""
"Wouldn't it be worse if you went along with it and had a terrible time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16304"
msgid "Well, yeah... Maybe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16316"
msgid "Mrargh. I'll just decide some other time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16328"
msgid "You're gonna have to decide at some point..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16340"
msgid "You should just go. Have a new experience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16352"
msgid "Huh? You for real right now!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16364"
msgid ""
"This is a group date we're talkin' here! You know I might actually find "
"someone there, don't ya!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16376"
msgid "That's why I'm saying you should go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16388"
msgid "Oh... Well then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16400"
msgid "Guess that clears that up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16412"
msgid "...Man. I'm starting to feel lonely and rejected already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16424"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16436"
msgid "How about I go with you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16448"
msgid "...What? Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16460"
msgid "Maybe I could help you have a better time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16472"
msgid "Seriously!?"
msgstr "Dici sul serio!?"

msgctxt "16484"
msgid "...Well, I guess that'd be okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16496"
msgid "Hold up! Are you just pullin' my leg here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16508"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16520"
msgid "Are you sayin' that 'cause... you're worried about me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16532"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16544"
msgid "Kiryu-san... You really do care about me, don't ya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16556"
msgid "I do."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "16568"
msgid "Ahahahaha... Aww... ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16580"
msgid "If me going to that group date worries ya that badly, then forget it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16592"
msgid "I ain't gonna go. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16604"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16616"
msgid "You know what's been super annoying lately?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16628"
msgid "Barkers! Those little wannabe hosts keep pesterin' me wherever I go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16640"
msgid ""
"There's this one who's especially annoying. He uses the same line over and "
"over whenever a girl ignores him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16652"
msgid "\"Fine, walk away! I only felt sorry for your ugly ass anyway!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16664"
msgid ""
"It's like, what's wrong with you, dude!? Instead of handin' out pocket "
"tissues, use 'em to wipe up the mess of a human being ya are!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16676"
msgid "You should beat his ass, Kiryu-san! Give him 2,000 lumps on the head!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16688"
msgid "Isn't that a bit extreme?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16700"
msgid "No way! 2,000 hits oughta do it... and that's minimum, by the way! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16712"
msgid "Oh? I thought maybe 500 hits would be more appropriate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16724"
msgid "Hahaha! ♪ Sounds like he'd get pretty thrashed either way! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16736"
msgid "Heh. That's the point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16748"
msgid ""
"I'm surprised, Kiryu-san. Is this the first time ya ever cracked a joke?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16760"
msgid "That was no joke. I'm serious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16772"
msgid "Ahahaha, that's great! ♪ Keep 'em coming! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16784"
msgid "Looks like my personality's starting to rub off on ya, eh? Hahaha! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16796"
msgid "Maybe just a little."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16808"
msgid "They only bother you because you're so cute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16820"
msgid "Eh? What's that ya say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16832"
msgid "They only bother you because you're so cute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16844"
msgid "Come again? And speak up, would ya!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16856"
msgid "Fine. I was saying it's because you're so cute..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16868"
msgid ""
"Ahahaha! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Call me cute that many times and I might "
"really start to believe it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16880"
msgid "Hey, you're the one who made me say it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16892"
msgid "It's fine, as long as you really mean it! You... do mean it, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16904"
msgid "Well... yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16916"
msgid "Come on! Stop being such a tease, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16928"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16940"
msgid "They're just barkers. Let them be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16952"
msgid ""
"Why should I get called names by some asswipe handing out tissues? It ain't "
"fair!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16964"
msgid ""
"I understand, but remember, these guys run their mouths at everyone. Getting"
" angry won't solve anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16976"
msgid "I understand that, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16988"
msgid ""
"I'm just askin' you to listen to me, not try and come up with an answer for "
"every problem I have!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17000"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17012"
msgid "You ever gone traveling, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17024"
msgid "Traveling, huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17036"
msgid "For me, my latest destination's been Cebu Island!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17048"
msgid "Cebu Island? Where's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17060"
msgid ""
"Well, it ain't no Guam or Saipan. It's somewhere most people haven't really "
"heard of. That's why I like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17072"
msgid "It's in the Philippines... I think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17084"
msgid ""
"Anyway, wherever it is, it's a real nice place. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17096"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17108"
msgid ""
"I was going through my camera yesterday, and pictures of my first trip to "
"Cebu started poppin' up. Got me feelin' all nostalgic..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17120"
msgid ""
"Nothing like stretchin' out on the beach, toastin' under the warm tropical "
"sun, and sippin' on a pina colada. Nonalcoholic, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17132"
msgid "That does sound nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17144"
msgid "The hotel was the best part!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17156"
msgid ""
"They even had an infinity pool that dipped straight into the ocean! Can you "
"believe that!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17168"
msgid ""
"I was having so much fun, I only slept two or three hours a night! ♪ Ahhhh, "
"I'm so crazy. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17180"
msgid "Sounds like a wild time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17192"
msgid "You know it! And I'm definitely going back again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17204"
msgid "I'd like to go, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17216"
msgid ""
"You should stay at the place I went to! It was this dreamy, all-inclusive "
"resort. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17228"
msgid "Ah. Sounds nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17240"
msgid "You'll run out of money real quick, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17252"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "17264"
msgid "But still! I guarantee it's worth it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17276"
msgid "I imagine so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17288"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17300"
msgid "Mm. I think you'd fit right in on Cebu Island!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17312"
msgid "Oh! I got it! The image just came to me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17324"
msgid ""
"You'll be wearing this cute Hawaiian shirt, right!? And longish, white "
"shorts to show off those hairy legs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17336"
msgid ""
"And you'll be sittin' there, drinking... I dunno, pineapple juice? Hahahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17348"
msgid "Heh, sounds about right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17360"
msgid "Yeah! You'll finally be able to let out your inner grandpa! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17372"
msgid "Hey, I'm not a grandpa just yet... Not by a longshot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17384"
msgid "I'd prefer somewhere up north."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17396"
msgid "Uh. Helloooo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17408"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "17420"
msgid "What did ya say just now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17432"
msgid "I said I'd rather go somewhere up north on vacation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17444"
msgid "...Your ears clogged or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17456"
msgid "Or is this your idea of being funny?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17468"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "17480"
msgid "Don't you \"heh\" me, mister!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17492"
msgid ""
"I mean, it's true, we were talkin' about vacation and traveling and all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17504"
msgid "But see here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17516"
msgid ""
"The topic I really brought up was a beautiful tropical island, which "
"<Italic>should</Italic> suggest an image of the clear blue sky or the deep "
"blue ocean..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17528"
msgid ""
"And you bring up some godforsaken, ice-covered wasteland up north? That's..."
" so sad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17540"
msgid "...Sorry for having a different opinion?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17552"
msgid "Sounds like you'd like Okinawa, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17564"
msgid "Okinawa, eh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17576"
msgid "Actually, that does sound nice. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17588"
msgid "It's great."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17600"
msgid "Well, what all about Okinawa do ya like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17612"
msgid "Shouldn't it be obvious?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17624"
msgid "Their awamori."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17636"
msgid "Aww... So it really is all about the alcohol, huh...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17648"
msgid ""
"Definitely. It's so good, there were times I'd stay up drinking even into "
"the early morning..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17660"
msgid "...Sheesh, I feel like I'm gettin' drunk just listenin' to ya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17672"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17732"
msgid ""
"Ooh, a fresh new face. Well, don't be shy, come on over! The name's Rin "
"Sasaba. Promise I'll take good care of ya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17768"
msgid "Heya! Welcome to the club!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17780"
msgid "Aha, I knew you'd be back for me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17792"
msgid "Come on in and make yourself at home!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17804"
msgid "That was way better than I expected. Let's go out again sometime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17816"
msgid "I was waitin' so long for you... Kiryu-san, what happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17828"
msgid ""
"Shame things didn't work out last time. Don't take it to mean we can't try "
"again, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17840"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san... I thought you were gonna treat me like a princess and take me "
"all sorts of places..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17852"
msgid "Sorry about last time, Kiryu-san. Guess we should reschedule, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17864"
msgid ""
"Hehe, hope you're into Kansai girls. As long as you don't make any lame "
"takoyaki jokes, then we're cool! Oh, and nice to meet ya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17876"
msgid "Nice to meet you, too."
msgstr "Piacere mio."

msgctxt "17888"
msgid "Aww, did you come just for me? I'm happy now."
msgstr ""

